<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f6f6f2">
  <title>Safety Travel · Reva</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/safety-travel.css">
</head>
<body class="travel-page">
  <header class="app-header travel-header">
    <a class="wordmark" href="/tracker" aria-label="Back to Reva home">
      <span class="wordmark-mark" aria-hidden="true">r.</span>
      <span><strong>reva</strong><small>stay close, feel connected</small></span>
    </a>
    <a class="travel-back" href="/tracker"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> Back to home</a>
  </header>

  <main class="travel-shell">
    <section class="travel-hero">
      <div class="travel-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">REVA CARE · JOURNEY SAFETY</p>
        <h1>Every journey,<br><em>with a little more peace of mind.</em></h1>
        <p>Tell Reva where you’re heading. Review your route before you start, then keep your trusted people in the loop.</p>
        <div class="travel-trust"><span aria-hidden="true">◈</span> Your journey is shared only with the people you authorize.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="travel-hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="route-orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="route-orbit orbit-two"></div>
        <div class="route-path"><span class="route-point point-start"></span><span class="route-point point-end"></span><span class="route-car">➤</span></div>
        <div class="art-label label-start"><span> A </span><b>Start</b></div>
        <div class="art-label label-end"><span> C </span><b>Destination</b></div>
        <div class="art-caption">YOUR ROUTE, YOUR CHOICE</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="travel-layout">
      <section class="travel-main-card">
        <div class="travel-card-heading">
          <div class="travel-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</div>
          <div><p class="eyebrow">PLAN A JOURNEY</p><h2>Where are you going?</h2><p class="muted">Describe your trip naturally. Reva can ask for details if needed.</p></div>
        </div>
        <form id="journeyForm" class="journey-form">
          <div class="travel-form-grid">
            <div><label for="originText">Starting point</label><input id="originText" name="originText" maxlength="200" autocomplete="street-address" placeholder="e.g. Durg Railway Station" required></div>
            <div><label for="destinationText">Destination</label><input id="destinationText" name="destinationText" maxlength="200" placeholder="e.g. Raipur Airport" required></div>
          </div>
          <label for="journeyRequest">Journey note (optional)</label>
          <textarea id="journeyRequest" name="journeyRequest" rows="2" maxlength="500" placeholder="Anything your trusted contacts should know?"></textarea>
          <div class="form-hint">Enter recognizable places or addresses. Reva uses a free public geocoder, which may be rate-limited.</div>
          <div class="travel-form-grid">
            <div><label for="travelMode">Travel mode</label><select id="travelMode" name="travelMode"><option value="" disabled selected>Choose a travel mode</option><option value="walking">Walking</option><option value="bicycle">Bicycle</option><option value="motorcycle">Motorcycle</option><option value="scooter">Scooter</option><option value="auto_rickshaw">Auto-rickshaw</option><option value="car">Car</option><option value="running">Running</option><option value="wheelchair">Wheelchair</option><option value="kick_scooter">Kick scooter</option><option value="skateboard">Skateboard</option><option value="roller_skates">Roller skates</option></select></div>
            <div><label for="safetyLevel">Journey sharing</label><select id="safetyLevel" name="safetyLevel"><option value="ask">Ask me before sharing</option><option value="trusted">Share with my authorized trusted friends</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <label class="travel-consent"><input type="checkbox" id="understandSafety" required><span>I understand that journey tracking requires location permission and an available communication channel for live updates.</span></label>
          <button type="submit" class="travel-submit">Prepare my journey <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
          <p id="journeyFeedback" class="journey-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          <section id="journeyReview" class="travel-side-card" hidden aria-live="polite">
            <p class="eyebrow">ROUTE REVIEW</p><h3 id="routeSummary">Review your route</h3><p id="routeDetails"></p>
            <div id="trustedFriends" class="trusted-friends"><p>Choose which accepted friends may see this journey.</p><p id="friendsStatus">Loading your accepted friends…</p><div id="friendChoices"></div></div>
            <label class="travel-consent"><input type="checkbox" id="approveJourney"><span>I reviewed this route and explicitly approve starting this journey and GPS tracking.</span></label>
            <button type="button" id="approveJourneyButton" class="travel-submit">Approve route and start journey</button>
          </section>
          <section id="activeJourneyControls" class="travel-side-card" hidden aria-live="polite">
            <p class="eyebrow">JOURNEY CONTROLS</p><h3>You're in control</h3><p id="activeJourneyStatus">Journey tracking is active.</p>
            <div class="travel-form-grid">
              <button type="button" id="checkInButton" class="travel-submit">I'm safe — check in</button>
              <button type="button" id="arrivedButton" class="travel-submit">I've arrived</button>
              <button type="button" id="emergencyButton" class="travel-submit">Send emergency alert</button>
              <button type="button" id="cancelJourneyButton" class="travel-submit">Cancel journey</button>
            </div>
          </section>
        </form>
      </section>

      <aside class="travel-side">
        <section class="travel-side-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</p>
          <div class="travel-step"><span>01</span><div><b>Describe your trip</b><p>Tell Reva your start and destination in your own words.</p></div></div>
          <div class="travel-step"><span>02</span><div><b>Review real route options</b><p>Compare route distance and estimated time before choosing.</p></div></div>
          <div class="travel-step"><span>03</span><div><b>Approve and travel</b><p>Start monitoring only after you approve the route and sharing settings.</p></div></div>
          <div class="travel-step"><span>04</span><div><b>Check in safely</b><p>Confirm arrival. If you’re overdue, Reva can request a check-in and notify authorized contacts when delivery is possible.</p></div></div>
        </section>
        <section class="travel-offline-card" aria-labelledby="offlineStatusTitle">
          <span class="offline-symbol" aria-hidden="true">⌁</span>
          <div><h3 id="offlineStatusTitle">Offline journey status</h3><p id="connectionStatus" role="status" aria-live="polite">Checking connection…</p><p id="queueStatus">Checking saved journey updates…</p><p id="gpsStatus">GPS permission has not been requested.</p><p id="lastGpsStatus">No GPS fix has been saved on this device yet.</p><p id="serverLocationStatus">Checking last server-confirmed location…</p><p class="offline-disclaimer">Only approved journeys can queue progress. Friends see the last server-confirmed location until syncing succeeds.</p></div>
        </section>
      </aside>
    </div>
    <footer class="travel-footer"><span>Reva Safety Travel</span><span>Private by choice · You stay in control</span></footer>
  </main>
  <script src="/js/journey-offline-queue.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/safety-travel.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
